OL,3,GNEWSATwo arrested after teenager dies
OL,4,Aat house
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people have been arrested after a
OL,7,Fteenager died at a house in Nuneaton.
OL,9,FWarwickshire Police said officers were
OL,10,Fcalled by ambulance crews to College
OL,11,FStreet at 15:41 GMT on Monday where
OL,12,Fthey found a woman in her late teens
OL,13,Fsuffering a cardiac arrest.
OL,15,FA 48-year-old woman and a 50-year-old
OL,16,Fman, both from Nuneaton, have since
OL,17,Fbeen arrested on suspicion of allowing
OL,18,Fthe death of a vulnerable adult.
OL,20,FPolice said inquiries were ongoing and
OL,21,Fhave urged anyone with information to
OL,22,Fcome forward.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
